      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_19",
        on: "wrapup",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Howgarth_III",
            type: "General",
            side: 4,
            x: 31,
            y: 23,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Howgarth_III",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_41",
            type: "Royal Guard",
            side: 4,
            x: 30,
            y: 24,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_41",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_42",
            type: "Royal Guard",
            side: 4,
            x: 32,
            y: 23,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_42",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Howgarth III",
            text: _("Hold it! What in the wide green world is going on here!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Earl Lanbec'h",
            portrait: "portraits/lanbech.webp~FL()~RIGHT()",
            text: _("Howgarth? You and your interfering alliance always show up at the worst possible time."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Earl Lanbec'h",
            portrait: "portraits/lanbech.webp~FL()~RIGHT()",
            text: _("<i>(_Curses! He is here already?! I had the messengers of the Alliance bribed to ensure no messages reached Dwarven Doors. I suppose it was only a matter of time...)</i>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kapou'e",
            portrait: "portraits/kapoue-angry.webp",
            text: _("Just who do you think you are, slug?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Howgarth III",
            text: _("I am Howgarth of the Northern Alliance, successor to the late Rahul I."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Earl Lanbec'h",
            portrait: "portraits/lanbech.webp~FL()~RIGHT()",
            text: _("This is a strictly territorial matter, Howgarth. The Northern Alliance has no right to intervene in this affair."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Howgarth III",
            text: _("The hell I don’t, Earl Lanbec’h, the Northern Alliance was witness to a treaty some seventeen years ago between your people and the orcs, which both of you are no doubt violating. It is our duty as the orchestrator and witness of this treaty to see that it is honored."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Earl Lanbec'h",
            portrait: "portraits/lanbech.webp~FL()~RIGHT()",
            text: _("Well, good for you. As a matter of fact, this land is clearly defined under your precious treaty as human territory. So if you are so keen on being all high and noble, then muster your men to help us push back this orcish menace."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Howgarth III",
            text: _("Cease your lies, Lanbec’h. We all know that you were the one who started this war. But enough. It is time for all this to end. I call for both sides to parley and we shall discuss this matter."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kapou'e",
            portrait: "portraits/kapoue-angry.webp",
            text: _("Ha ha, very funny, old fool. You think we are stupid enough to fall for that? I’ve not forgotten what you people did to my father."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Howgarth III",
            text: _("What in the world are you talking about?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kapou'e",
            portrait: "portraits/kapoue-angry.webp",
            text: _("I am Kapou’e, son of the Black-Eye Karun. Seventeen years ago, you people assassinated my father after inviting him to join the Northern Alliance."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Howgarth III",
            text: _("What? We received word that he declined our invitation and that was the end of the matter. I know nothing of his assassination. As a matter of fact, I was there when the orcish messenger brought Rahul Karun’s reply."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kapou'e",
            portrait: "portraits/kapoue-angry.webp",
            text: _("Messenger, what messenger?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Howgarth III",
            text: _("If I remember correctly, it was some orc named Shan Taum."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kapou'e",
            text: _("Funny, that name sounds oddly familiar..."),
          },
        ],
      },
